# 🌟 **Why this idea is so good**

💡 You don’t depend on real stock data
💡 LLM adds reasoning + intelligence
💡 Classical model adds stability
💡 Final risk model learns to balance both
💡 Best possible decision making with limited data

This becomes a **smart, hybrid assistant** — perfect for a hackathon.

